  {
    "title": "A File Integrity Monitor (FIM)",
    "thumbnail": "https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/3d181550-0dc0-422c-b277-574a1e76f82b/1692979282561-2.jpg",
    "description": "A File Integrity Monitor that allows users to track down real-time insights on file changes. Developed using PowerShell scripting. Welcome to the File Integrity Monitoring (FIM) System repository! This tool helps you monitor the integrity of your files, safeguarding your digital assets against unauthorized changes. Whether you're a cybersecurity enthusiast or just curious about maintaining data security, this tool is for you.",
    "long_description": "A File Integrity Monitor that allows users to track down real-time insights on file changes. Developed using PowerShell scripting. Welcome to the File Integrity Monitoring (FIM) System repository! This tool helps you monitor the integrity of your files, safeguarding your digital assets against unauthorized changes. Whether you're a cybersecurity enthusiast or just curious about maintaining data security, this tool is for you.\n\n📋 How does it work? It's simple! The system has two modes:\n\n1️⃣ Collecting Baseline: Start by collecting a baseline of your files' hash values. This essentially captures the current state of your files and their hashes. If you spot any unexpected changes in the future, you'll have something to compare against.\n\n2️⃣ Monitoring Mode: Once you have your baseline, switch to the monitoring mode. The system continuously scans your files, recalculates their hash values, and compares them to the baseline. If a file is created, modified, or deleted, you'll be notified in real-time, thanks to color-coded alerts that I've included.\n\n🟢 Green: New files added.\n🔵 Blue: Files remain unchanged.\n🟣 Magenta: Files have been modified.\n🔴 Dark Red: Files have been deleted.\n\n📁 Getting Started: You can grab the code for this FIM system from my GitHub repository. Clone it, set it up, and run it in your own environment. The repository includes step-by-step instructions to guide you through the setup process.",
    "skills": [
      "FIM",
      "POWERSHELL",
      "MONITORING"
    ],
    "link": "https://medium.com/@lakshan.sam28/building-a-file-integrity-monitoring-fim-system-for-enhanced-security-9e8a666de655",
    "categories": [
      "Defensive - Blue Teaming"
    ],
    "date": "2023-08-09",
    "images": [
      "https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/40900c5e-ffab-48eb-97ef-a8d169b98baa/1692979282561-2.jpg"
