  {
    "title": "Azure & OpenVAS Cybersecurity Vulnerability Management Project",
    "thumbnail": "https://files.elfsightcdn.com/eafe4a4d-3436-495d-b748-5bdce62d911d/21b32b6d-715a-4b6d-abf1-25b7f526075b/1719157274663.jpg",
    "description": "Transforming Cybersecurity with Azure and OpenVAS: Empowering Secure Vulnerability Management I recently completed a comprehensive cybersecurity vulnerability management project using Microsoft Azure and OpenVAS. This project involved setting up a secure Azure network, creating a vulnerable Windows 10 VM, performing unauthenticated and credentialed scans, analyzing the results, and remediating identified vulnerabilities",
    "long_description": "Transforming Cybersecurity with Azure and OpenVAS: Empowering Secure Vulnerability Management I recently completed a comprehensive cybersecurity vulnerability management project using Microsoft Azure and OpenVAS. This project involved setting up a secure Azure network, creating a vulnerable Windows 10 VM, performing unauthenticated and credentialed scans, analyzing the results, and remediating identified vulnerabilities \n\n⏺️ Set up a secure Azure network with OpenVAS.\n⏺️ Developed a vulnerable Windows 10 VM by installing outdated software.\n⏺️ Performed unauthenticated and credentialed scans.\n⏺️ Analyzed scan results, highlighting the difference between unauthenticated and credentialed scans.\n⏺️ Remediated vulnerabilities and verified successful remediation through subsequent scans.\n\nThis project enhanced my skills in vulnerability management and security analysis. Check out my detailed report here! 🥹👇🏻👇🏻",
