    "description": "As part of the Mastercard Cybersecurity Virtual Experience Program on Forage, I stepped into the role of a Cybersecurity Analyst on Mastercard’s Security Awareness Team.",
    "long_description": "As part of the Mastercard Cybersecurity Virtual Experience Program on Forage, I stepped into the role of a Cybersecurity Analyst on Mastercard’s Security Awareness Team. This immersive simulation provided hands-on experience in threat identification, security awareness, and risk mitigation within a corporate environment.\n\nKey Takeaways:\n\n🔹 Threat Detection & Reporting: Identified and reported security threats, including phishing attacks, helping to strengthen Mastercard’s cybersecurity defenses.\n\n🔹 Security Awareness & Training: Conducted risk analysis to determine which areas of the business required enhanced security training. Developed and implemented customized security training courses and procedures to address vulnerabilities and improve overall security posture.\n\n🔹 Cybersecurity Strategy & Risk Mitigation: Applied best practices in security awareness to educate teams on recognizing and responding to potential cyber threats, reinforcing a culture of cyber resilience within the organization.\n\nThis experience enhanced my ability to proactively assess security risks, design awareness programs, and contribute to organizational security strategies—key skills for today’s cybersecurity professionals.",
